<title>JAPAN: BOJ governor to speak in parliament on Friday.</title>
<headline>BOJ governor to speak in parliament on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Japan (BOJ) Governor Yasuo Matsushita will attend a parliamentary committee meeting on Friday between 10.10 a.m. (0110 GMT) and 12.00 p.m. (0300 GMT) to answer questions from members of the Lower House, the BOJ said in a statement issued late on Thursday.</p>
</text>
